---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<section class="bg-[var(--ink)] text-white"><div class="container grid gap-10 py-20 md:grid-cols-[1fr_0.8fr] md:items-center md:py-24"><div><p class="eyebrow !text-[#f5b6a6]">Ready when you are</p><h2 class="display mt-4 text-5xl leading-tight">Let's make the next step a good one.</h2><p class="mt-5 max-w-lg leading-7 text-[#c9d5d3]">Tell us a little about what you are working through. We will get back to you within two business days.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><a class="rounded-full bg-[var(--coral)] px-6 py-4 text-center font-bold text-[var(--ink)] hover:bg-[#f58d78]" href={`${base}/contact`}>Send a message</a><a class="rounded-full border border-[#77908d] px-6 py-4 text-center font-bold text-white hover:bg-white/10" href="tel:+15551234567">Call (555) 123-4567</a></div></div></section>